            and for the actual Tab Panel if it uses <span class="code-span">tabindex=0</span>
        </p>
        <table aria-labelledby="outline-misc-variables">

            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Variable Name</th>
                    <th scope="col">Default Value</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-tabs-outline-style</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-outline-style)</td>
                    <td>The style of the outline - uses the shared component variable.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-tabs-outline-width</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-outline-width)</td>
                    <td>The outline colour - uses the shared component variable.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-tabs-outline-offset</td>
                    <td>0px</td>
                    <td>The outline offest - <b>does not use the shared variable.</b></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-tabs-outline-colour</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-outline-colour)</td>
                    <td>The outline colour - uses the shared component variable.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-tabs-selected-hover</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-selection-colour)</td>
                    <td>The background colour on hover of a selected tab - uses the shared component variable.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>--br-comp-tabs-hover</td>
                    <td>var(--br-comp-all-link-hover-background-colour)</td>
                    <td>
                        The background colour on hover of an unselected tab - uses the shared component variable.
                        <b>Note:</b> Tabs are buttons not links, but this exisiting css variable was suitable.
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
